{% extends "layout.html" %}
{% block title %}Dreams — CSR Dream Journal{% endblock %}
{% block masthead_meta %}<span>week-dreams</span>{% endblock %}
{#- Home is a verdict, not a menu. The curator's #1 speaks as THE next
    move; runners-up are demoted to one line each. The evidence log lives
    at /board — an empty home is abstention, not a missing log. -#}
{% block shell %}
<div class="shell">
  <aside class="sidebar">
    <p class="rail-title">Journal</p>
    <ul class="nav">
      <li><a class="current" href="/">Dreams</a></li>
      <li><a href="/board">Board</a></li>
    </ul>
  </aside>
  <main class="main">
    {% if view.next_move %}
    <div class="wrap">
      <section class="next-move">
        <p class="week-kicker">next move (dreamed) · {{ view.next_move.kind_label }} · {{ view.next_move.project }}</p>
        <h1><a href="{{ view.next_move.href }}">{{ view.next_move.title }}</a></h1>
        {% if view.next_move.hypothesis %}<p class="week-hypothesis">{{ view.next_move.hypothesis }}</p>{% endif %}
        {% if view.next_move.how %}
        <ol class="week-how">
          {% for step in view.next_move.how %}<li>{{ step }}</li>{% endfor %}
        </ol>
        {% endif %}
      </section>
      {% if view.runners_up %}
      <section class="runners-up">
        <h2>Also live this week</h2>
        <ul class="week-dreams">
          {% for dream in view.runners_up %}
          <li class="week-dream">
            <p class="week-kicker">{{ dream.kind_label }} · {{ dream.project }}</p>
            <p class="week-runner"><a href="{{ dream.href }}">{{ dream.title }}</a></p>
          </li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ul>
      </section>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
    {% else %}
    <div class="empty">
      <p class="lead">No next move is dreamed yet.</p>
      <p>That is abstention, not an empty week. A move appears here only when a
         second deliberation over the week has a gated <em>how</em> or a
         matched night-thread hypothesis. The hypothesis on that move is one
         free sentence; the how is not free.</p>
      <p>The session log and evidence board stay at <a href="/board">/board</a>.</p>
    </div>
    {% endif %}
  </main>
</div>
{% endblock %}
